WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
You give directions. A door passes.
The stranger in front of you changes.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In a 1998 field study, many pedestrians missed the switch.
This was not hypnosis.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Seeing an object now isn't the same
as remembering every detail from before.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Some meditation research examines attention,
but not this specific audio course.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Start with a free twelve-minute exercise.
Notice what you actually do.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Compare formats, evidence limits,
actual price and refund terms before deciding.
